    * [Space]   : Toggle live audio preview (downloads on demand if cloud)
    * [d]       : Delete local audio file from disk to save space
    * [/]       : Filter / Search sounds on the fly
    * [c]       : Cycle through categories ([All], [zikir], [durood], [istighfar])
    * [Enter]   : Confirm selection (downloads on demand if cloud)
