DYNAMIC SOUND MANAGEMENT:
    📁 Global Sound Library:
        ~/.ai-alarm/sound/

    Supported audio formats:
        .mp3, .wav, .m4a, .aac, .ogg, .flac, .aiff

    Ways to manage sounds:
      1. Run: alarm update              (syncs latest community catalog from GitHub)
      2. Run: alarm storage             (view disk usage and storage breakdown)
