SUPPORTED AI AGENTS & HOOKS:
    🟣 Claude Code       ~/.claude/settings.json       (hooks.Stop)
    🟢 OpenAI Codex      ~/.codex/config.toml          ([[hooks.Stop]])
    🔵 Antigravity       ~/.gemini/config/hooks.json   (task-finished-alarm.Stop)
    🟡 OpenCode          ~/.config/opencode/plugins/   (session.idle)

EXAMPLES:
    alarm                     # Triggers alarm (used by hooks)
